    {
      "id": "p0062-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In-house localization departments and industry-specific localization companies usually have more resources at their disposal than generic \"one stop shop\" translation agencies. These extra resources allow for larger localization teams filled with qualified specialists. This means that 8-4, as a dedicated game localization company, was able to give Undertale the same treatment as a big-budget game from a major studio.",
        "raw": "In-house localization departments and industry-specific localization\ncompanies usually have more resources at their disposal than generic \"one\nstop shop\" translation agencies. These extra resources allow for larger\nlocalization teams filled with qualified specialists. This means that 8-4, as a\ndedicated game localization company, was able to give Undertale the same\ntreatment as a big-budget game from a major studio.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.290545,
          0.17355714,
          0.86906298,
          0.27790714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28845079,
          0.17284286,
