    {
      "id": "p0062-b005",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "One English-to-Japanese translator who performed all of the raw text translation and localization, as well as the final polishing pass A programmer who reprogrammed parts of the game to work properly in Japanese and on game consoles Multiple bilingual translators who pointed out translation mistakes and oversights, and made alternative localization suggestions Multiple editors who documented text issues and offered feedback for the lead translator to consider implementing during the final polishing phase A producer who managed all of these people",
        "raw": "One English-to-Japanese translator who performed all of the raw text\ntranslation and localization, as well as the final polishing pass\nA programmer who reprogrammed parts of the game to work properly in\nJapanese and on game consoles\nMultiple bilingual translators who pointed out translation mistakes and\noversights, and made alternative localization suggestions\nMultiple editors who documented text issues and offered feedback for the\nlead translator to consider implementing during the final polishing phase\nA producer who managed all of these people",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.33585497,
          0.32062143,
          0.90034384,
          0.51731429
