    {
      "id": "p0062-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As the fan translations demonstrated, it would've been feasible to produce a bare-bones Japanese version of Undertale in a matter of months. Toby and 8-4 weren't in a rush to push a release out the door, though, so the localization team took its time with the project. In total, eighteen months of work went into Undertale's Japanese release.",
        "raw": "As the fan translations demonstrated, it would've been feasible to produce a\nbare-bones Japanese version of Underta/e in a matter of months. Toby and 8-4\nweren't in a rush to push a release out the door, though, so the localization\nteam took its time with the project. In total, eighteen months of work went\ninto Undertale's Japanese release.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
